{
    "title": "Ludo STAR: Online Dice Game",
    "description": "Our multiplayer board game is better and smarter than ever before!  Connect with friends and challenge them to one of the oldest, most popular dice games in the world. Play multiple games online at the same time, track your moves and improve your stats.\r\nShow off your dice rolling skills as you search for the highest score in our beloved classic board game.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccbFEATURES:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafCHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS\ud83c\udfaf\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 The multiplayer board game showdown starts here. Keep up your brain training by challenging your friends and family members who love the thrill of this classic dice game, or use random match to find your perfect opponent. Prove you have what it takes to become the ludo king or queen in this entertaining board game.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafCOMPLETE GOALS AND GET REWARDED\ud83c\udfaf\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Roll the perfect dice to complete levels and unlock exclusive collectibles with Season Pass in this classic board game! With a new season every 6 weeks, there is always something new and exciting to collect! In this classic board game, climb the rewards track and put your dice rolling skills to the test in this brain teaser and collect them all!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafVOICE CHAT WITH ANYONE\ud83c\udfaf\r\n\ud83c\udfb2Break the ice with people nearby or around the world. Unlike some other apps, voice chat is always free\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafPLAY SPEED DICE IN QUICK PLAY EVENTS!\ud83c\udfaf\r\n\ud83c\udfb2Beat the ludo blitz in our new game modes. Play multiplayer dice games with friends and be the fastest to score the most points!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddTESTIMONIALS:\r\n\r\n\u201cGreat board game for playing with friends or anybody else that loves ludo\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cI love this game!!! It\u2019s as simple as that. A must have for the ludo player in all of us\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cGreat board game that challenges your mind, and helps you learn new skills while playing with friends\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cMy favourite app. The first app I check each morning. The only ludo game I play every day. I\u2019ve got a dozen opponents across the globe. My favourite app by far.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce3COMMUNITY:\r\n\r\nCasual puzzles, multiplayer board game, and dice games aficionado? Like us on Facebook or follow us on Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/ludostarhd/?hl=en\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/ludostarhd/\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2757DISCLAIMER::\r\nUse of this application is governed by Gameberry Labs Pvt. Ltd. Terms of Use. Collection and use of personal data are subject to Gameberry Labs Privacy Policy. Both policies are available at www.gameberrylabs.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Our multiplayer board game is better and smarter than ever before!  Connect with friends and challenge them to one of the oldest, most popular dice games in the world. Play multiple games online at the same time, track your moves and improve your stats.<br>Show off your dice rolling skills as you search for the highest score in our beloved classic board game.<br><br>\ud83d\udccbFEATURES:<br><br>\ud83c\udfafCHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS\ud83c\udfaf<br>\ud83c\udfb2 The multiplayer board game showdown starts here. Keep up your brain training by challenging your friends and family members who love the thrill of this classic dice game, or use random match to find your perfect opponent. Prove you have what it takes to become the ludo king or queen in this entertaining board game.<br><br>\ud83c\udfafCOMPLETE GOALS AND GET REWARDED\ud83c\udfaf<br>\ud83c\udfb2 Roll the perfect dice to complete levels and unlock exclusive collectibles with Season Pass in this classic board game! With a new season every 6 weeks, there is always something new and exciting to collect! In this classic board game, climb the rewards track and put your dice rolling skills to the test in this brain teaser and collect them all!<br><br>\ud83c\udfafVOICE CHAT WITH ANYONE\ud83c\udfaf<br>\ud83c\udfb2Break the ice with people nearby or around the world. Unlike some other apps, voice chat is always free<br><br>\ud83c\udfafPLAY SPEED DICE IN QUICK PLAY EVENTS!\ud83c\udfaf<br>\ud83c\udfb2Beat the ludo blitz in our new game modes. Play multiplayer dice games with friends and be the fastest to score the most points!<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcddTESTIMONIALS:<br><br>\u201cGreat board game for playing with friends or anybody else that loves ludo\u201d<br><br>\u201cI love this game!!! It\u2019s as simple as that. A must have for the ludo player in all of us\u201d<br><br>\u201cGreat board game that challenges your mind, and helps you learn new skills while playing with friends\u201d<br><br>\u201cMy favourite app. The first app I check each morning. The only ludo game I play every day. I\u2019ve got a dozen opponents across the globe. My favourite app by far.<br><br>\ud83d\udce3COMMUNITY:<br><br>Casual puzzles, multiplayer board game, and dice games aficionado? Like us on Facebook or follow us on Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!<br><br>https://www.instagram.com/ludostarhd/?hl=en<br>https://www.facebook.com/ludostarhd/<br><br><br>\u2757DISCLAIMER::<br>Use of this application is governed by Gameberry Labs Pvt. Ltd. Terms of Use. Collection and use of personal data are subject to Gameberry Labs Privacy Policy. Both policies are available at www.gameberrylabs.com.",
